load ../infoflow-output-integrity.maude

--- Effect-output integrity (DR-0046). Coverage: an unvouched executor's
--- output denies at a vouched sink by payload and by selector, and the
--- endorsed marker without its grant denies. Bite: a vouched executor writes
--- freely, the granted endorsed judgment arms, and the axis lock holds --
--- an output token never produces a confidentiality leak.

--- ============================ COVERAGE, influence reachable ================

--- Coverage: unvouched output as the vouched sink's payload.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  payload(lo, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg influence .

--- Coverage: unvouched output SELECTING the arm the vouched sink sits in --
--- the implicit channel is the same influence.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  selector(lo, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg influence .

--- Coverage: the endorsed marker without its grant is a declaration, not
--- authority.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  endorsedVia(lo, hi, false)
  =>* C:Cfg influence .

--- ============================ BITE, no influence ===========================

--- Bite: a vouched executor (provided hi) shapes the vouched sink freely.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  payload(hi, hi) selector(hi, hi)
  =>* RESIDUAL:Cfg influence .

--- Bite: the granted endorsed judgment arms the unvouched executor.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  endorsedVia(lo, hi, true)
  =>* RESIDUAL:Cfg influence .

--- Bite: the axis lock -- no output constructor can ever produce a
--- confidentiality leak, whatever its levels.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-OUTPUT-INTEGRITY :
  payload(lo, hi) selector(lo, hi) endorsedVia(lo, hi, false) confAudit
  =>* RESIDUAL:Cfg confLeak .
